# Editor scratch. WebStorm and VS Code both write temp files here mid-session.
.vscode/

# Written by apps/demo-server at runtime. Running the demo must not dirty the tree,
# and it must not fail format:check. The `.tmp` sibling is the half of the
# write-and-rename that only exists between two syscalls, and a kill in that gap
# leaves it behind -- so it needs ignoring too, or a crash dirties the tree.
apps/demo-server/forms.json
apps/demo-server/forms.json.tmp
